(1) MODULUS TRANSVERSALITY: gcd(n,2n-1)=1, G_n ∩ G_{2n-1} = {0}
==============================================================================
  gcd(n,2n-1) over n=2..1999: nontrivial cases = []  (empty => always 1)
  G_n ∩ G_(2n-1) \ {0} nonempty for n=2..59: 0 cases (0 => transverse)

  Worry-set: is any pair BOTH floor-active (sum≡0 mod n) AND shell-partner
  (sum≡0 mod 2n-1)?  (would need sum ≡0 mod n(2n-1); worry speeds too small)
  tight configs n=4..8: pairs that are BOTH = 0  (0 => roles disjoint)

